<h2>Our lawful basis</h2><p>We rely on your consent (for example, when you tick the box on the contact form or accept analytics), and on our legitimate interest in running a charity and answering the people who contact us. We keep some records because the law requires it.</p>
<h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>The site works without cookies. It saves your cookie choice in your browser. Analytics cookies are used only if you press Accept. You can change your choice at any time with Cookie settings in the footer.</p>
