<h2>How long we keep data</h2><p>We keep messages only as long as needed to reply and for our records. Donation records are kept for as long as accounting and legal rules require.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>You may ask to see the personal data we hold about you, correct it, delete it, restrict or object to its use, receive a copy of it, or withdraw your consent at any time. Email <a href="mailto:<?=h($S['mail'])?>"><?=h($S['mail'])?></a> and we will respond. You may also complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission.</p>
<h2>Children and this website</h2><p>This website is meant for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children without the consent of a parent or guardian.</p>
